BoiScan experimental weight preview
===================================

This build includes YOLO11n-seg (Ultralytics) under AGPL-3.0. The corresponding
source is the public BoiScan repository (https://github.com/Rilen/boiscan) and
the Ultralytics repository (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics).
The combined build is distributed under AGPL-3.0; see LICENSE.

It also includes:
- MobileNetV3-small / torchvision weights under BSD-3-Clause;
- ONNX Runtime Web under MIT;
- training data A/B under CC BY 4.0 (attribution in /third-party.html).

The numeric result is experimental and is not a validated weighing.
